            <note corresp="#d181-f3" n="3" xml:id="d181-f3-content">
                <p>On June 8, President Eisenhower suffered
                    an attack of ileitis which required surgery on June 9. The President remained at
                        Walter Reed Hospital until June 30.</p>
            </note>
